OL,3,GNEWSAApplications open for secondary
OL,4,Aschool places
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and carers of Year 6 pupils in
OL,7,FWolverhampton can now apply for a
OL,8,Fsecondary school place for next
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,FFamilies have until 31 October to
OL,12,Fsubmit applications to the City of
OL,13,FWolverhampton Council.
OL,15,FJacqui Coogan, cabinet member for
OL,16,Fchildren, young people and education,
OL,17,Fsaid applying before the deadline could
OL,18,Fincrease the chances of securing a
OL,19,Fplace at a preferred school.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
